[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3307038353","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227#issuecomment-3307038353","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108227","id":3307038353,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FHWaR","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T11:51:41Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T11:51:41Z","body":"I'm not sure about that. It makes `kill()` more expensive to use even if you don't use sub-Tweens.\r\nMaybe Tween could have a `LocalVector<Ref<Tween>>`, containing sub-Tweens and appended in `tween_subtween()`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3307038353/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308344658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227#issuecomment-3308344658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108227","id":3308344658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FMVVS","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T16:10:45Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T16:10:45Z","body":"Thanks for taking a look!\r\n\r\nIt will definitely have some level of an adverse effect on the performance. It was programmed this way to keep a single source for the tween's contents. Adding a second vector/list/etc for subtweens means we have to ensure it is always updated in sync with the actual tween list; if we forget to update both structures in some operation, we could get some strange bugs. While the time complexity of the current approach is unarguably worse than what you're proposing, I also don't know if tweens would be large enough for that to become practically noticeable, especially given that `kill()` is a one-time operation (i.e., not something that should be run each frame).\r\n\r\nThis all being said, if you still think the 1D subtween vector approach would be a net improvement to what I have here, please let me know and I can change it to use that instead 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308344658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308955357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227#issuecomment-3308955357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108227","id":3308955357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FOqbd","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T18:18:15Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T18:18:15Z","body":"> we have to ensure it is always updated in sync with the actual tween list\r\n\r\nSub-Tweens can be added only by a single method and can't be removed, so it's not really a problem.\r\n\r\n> kill() is a one-time operation (i.e., not something that should be run each frame).\r\n\r\nWell, there is this pattern, which I think is quite common\r\n```GDScript\r\n# Kill old Tween if it exists.\r\nif tween:\r\n\ttween.kill()\r\n# Start new animation.\r\ntween = create_tween()\r\n```\r\nThough not sure if people call it often enough to have problems.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308955357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3310033441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227#issuecomment-3310033441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108227","id":3310033441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FSxoh","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T23:52:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T23:52:17Z","body":"> Sub-Tweens can be added only by a single method and can't be removed, so it's not really a problem.\r\n\r\nVery good point, yeah! Nothing's coming to mind for me for future points where this list would need to be updated to keep it in sync, so perhaps that worry was for (relatively) nothing 😅 \r\n\r\n> Well, there is this pattern, which I think is quite common\r\n> Though not sure if people call it often enough to have problems.\r\n\r\nAh, I use that pattern a lot myself! In my own experience, at least, the new animations aren't created frequently enough, and they don't have enough complexity/steps, where I feel like the game overall would be prone to a major slowdown...\r\n\r\n*Although*, it did just occur to me as I was typing this, that the worse time complexity on this isn't just a *worst*-case scenario, it's *guaranteed* because there's no early exit condition. Between that and the point you made about few places where the lists need to be updated, I think it does make sense to reimplement this fix using an approach like the one you described. I should hopefully have that up soon!\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3310033441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349237613","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227#issuecomment-3349237613","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108227","id":3349237613,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HoU9t","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T22:15:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T22:15:48Z","body":"@Meorge There is no need to keep rebasing the PR if there are no conflicts.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349237613/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349241605","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227#issuecomment-3349241605","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108227","id":3349241605,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HoV8F","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T22:17:30Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T22:17:30Z","body":"Alrighty thanks, sorry about that then! I'll check if there are conflicts before I attempt rebasing in the future 😅 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349241605/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377772839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227#issuecomment-3377772839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108227","id":3377772839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JVLkn","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T17:03:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T17:03:55Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377772839/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]